message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GaAsPN QFP drift-diffusion solver: publication snapshot"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: BSD-3-Clause
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kızıloğlu"
    given-names: "Volkan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0463-1219"
repository-code: "https://github.com/volkankiziloglu-dev/GaAsPN-DD-solver-publication"
keywords:
  - drift-diffusion
  - quasi-Fermi potential
  - Scharfetter-Gummel
  - GaAsPN
  - dilute nitride
  - indoor photovoltaics
  - MATLAB
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of a one-dimensional quasi-Fermi-potential drift-diffusion solver
  (Scharfetter-Gummel discretization, Gummel-alternating block Newton iteration with analytic
  Jacobians) and the scripts that produce the results, figures and tables of the paper comparing
  GaAsPN homojunction, front-heterojunction, GaP rear-surface-field, rear-heterojunction and
  p-i-n solar-cell architectures under AM1.5G and indoor illumination.
